    <string name="ut_about_title">About this app</string>
    <string name="ut_about_text">Runs the official minimal Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (ubuntu-base) image inside a PRoot container — no root required.\n\n• Terminal emulation: Termux terminal-emulator / terminal-view (GPLv3)\n• PRoot: proot-me / Termux fork (GPLv2+) with link2symlink\n• Root filesystem: ubuntu-base 26.04.1 (Canonical)\n\nTip: run \'apt update\' first, then install packages with \'apt install …\'. Your shared storage is mounted at /sdcard.</string>

